# Phase Reports - schema-version-parts

Phase completion reports are written here by `phase-into-result` when each phase
finishes. Expected files (created at completion, not in advance):

- `report-phase1.md` - Phase 1 (PR A1): canonical encoder + tag parser
- `report-phase2.md` - Phase 2 (PR A2): hand-written projectV1 + golden vectors
- `report-phase3.md` - Phase 3 (PR B): reset cutover

See `plan/schema-version-parts/overview.md` for status.
